Package: uoo-boot-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Uoo Boot Manager contributors <uoo@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, polkitd | policykit-1, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: grub-common, efibootmgr
Description: Desktop manager for Ubuntu GRUB and UEFI boot settings
 Inspect GRUB entries, select a default operating system, adjust the boot menu,
 and manage UEFI firmware boot order and the next boot entry.
 System changes use an authenticated helper and include backups.
